{{define "title"}}Your Chronos trial ends {{date .TrialEndsAt}}{{end}}
{{define "content"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hello{{if .Name}} {{.Name}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Your Chronos trial ends on <strong>{{datetime .TrialEndsAt}}</strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">There is no card on the account, so when the trial ends your
  organisation will be <strong>suspended</strong>: nobody will be able to sign in to it.
  Nothing is deleted, and nothing is charged.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Adding a card restores access immediately, whether you do it before
  the trial ends or afterwards. You can do that from Billing in your organisation settings.</p>
{{end}}
